<title>USA: Millipore sells unit to management.</title>
<headline>Millipore sells unit to management.</headline>
<dateline>BEDFORD, Mass. 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Millipore Corp said on Friday that it sold its interest in Class 1, a company located in Ocala, Florida, to management for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>Class 1, which manufactures emergency vehicle gauges and posted $8 million in annual revenues, was part of recently acquired Tylan General, Millipore said in a statement.</p>
<p>Millipore said Class 1 did not fit into its strategic direction.</p>
